    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2022-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Project Management Unit in place
2. 1 Inception Workshop conducted
3. 1 Inception Report received
4. Develop an Environmental and Social Impact Assessment, Environmental and Social Management Plan and Indigenous Peoples Plan, and a Project-level Grievance Redress Mechanism.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. The Project Management Unit is in place
2. An Inception Workshop was conducted and report available
3. The Inception Report received and made available to relevant stakeholders
4. A Social and Environmental Standards Officer(SESO) was recruited to work with a consultancy firm to develop an Environmental and Social Impact Assessment, Environmental and Social Management Plan and Indigenous Peoples Plan, and a Project-level Grievance Redress Mechanism 

In addition the following activities were carried out:
&#x2022;	Areas that need protective kraals identified and kraals constructed
&#x2022;	Water infrastructure developed and upgraded
&#x2022;	Training on HWC supported in all 3 project regions
&#x2022;	Radios procured for all 3 hotspot landscapes
